        "title": "Cross Multiply",
        "text": "Apply $$\\frac{a}{b}+\\frac{c}{d}=\\frac{ad+bc}{bd}$$ where $$a=x+1$$, $$b=x-1$$, $$c=2x+1$$, and $$d=x+3$$.",
